Event: `'stream'`
The 'stream' event is emitted when a new Http2Stream is created. 
session.on('stream', (stream, headers, flags) => {
  const method = headers[':method'];
  const path = headers[':path'];
  // ...
  stream.respond({
    ':status': 200,
